theorem k215UnpairAt3595Step9Z (a b c: nat): $ k215PStep (k215UnpairAt3595State k215PNum3595 a b 0 c) = (k215UnpairAt3595State k215PNum3603 a b 0 c) $ = '(eqtr (eqtr (k215PAtCD k215PLookupUnpair3595_3595) (ifeq (eqeq1 k215PGet2_vector) eqid eqid)) (ifpos eqid));

